etween haves and have-nots economic  depression on the continent of refugee  crisis brewing and a nation  rediscovering its pride in its own flag  and its own identity in hindsight it's  so obvious the ingredients were all  there for the lead vote four years later  but we were all too busy looking the  other way Eddie Conway Sky News  [Music]

